---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const title = 'About Alex Hilbert · Registered Investment Advisor, Scottsdale, Arizona | Life Story Wealth Planning';
const description = 'Alex Hilbert is a Registered Investment Advisor and fiduciary, formerly at Vanguard, now running Life Story Wealth Planning, a small Scottsdale investment advisory firm.';

const personSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'Person',
  name: 'Alex Hilbert',
  jobTitle: 'Registered Investment Advisor',
  alumniOf: 'Vanguard',
  worksFor: {
    '@type': 'FinancialService',
    name: 'Life Story Wealth Planning',
    url: 'https://lifestorywp.com',
  },
  address: {
    '@type': 'PostalAddress',
    addressLocality: 'Scottsdale',
    addressRegion: 'AZ',
    addressCountry: 'US',
  },
};
---
<Base title={title} description={description} canonicalPath="/about">
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(personSchema)} />
  </Fragment>

  <article class="chapter-page">
    <header class="about-hero">
      <figure class="about-portrait" aria-label="Alex Hilbert portrait, forthcoming">
        <div class="about-portrait-frame">
          <span class="about-portrait-corner tl" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="about-portrait-corner tr" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="about-portrait-corner bl" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="about-portrait-corner br" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="about-portrait-mono" aria-hidden="true">AH</span>
          <span class="about-portrait-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="about-portrait-firm" aria-hidden="true">Life Story <em>Wealth Planning</em></span>
        </div>
        <figcaption class="about-portrait-caption">Portrait forthcoming · Scottsdale, Arizona</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <div class="about-hero-copy">
        <p class="about-hero-eyebrow">Chapter · About</p>
        <h1 class="about-hero-h1">
          <span class="about-hero-first">Alex</span>
          <span class="about-hero-last">Hilbert</span>
        </h1>
        <div class="about-hero-credentials">
          <span>Registered Investment Advisor</span>
          <span class="ah-sep" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span>Fiduciary since 2012</span>
        </div>
        <p class="about-hero-epigraph">
          <span class="ah-quote" aria-hidden="true">“</span>Most people who arrive at this page were introduced by someone they trust. If that is how you got here, this is written for you.<span class="ah-quote ah-quote-end" aria-hidden="true">”</span>
        </p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="chapter-body">
      <section>
        <h3>Who I am</h3>
        <p>
          My name is Alex Hilbert. I run Life Story Wealth Planning, a small investment advisory
          firm in Scottsdale, Arizona. I am a Registered Investment Advisor, which in the United
          States is a specific, licensed role, not a job title anyone can adopt. Being an RIA also
          means I am a fiduciary. I am legally required to put my clients' interests ahead of my own.
        </p>
        <p>
          I have worked in this industry since 2012. Most of the people I work with came to me
          because someone they trust suggested it. If that is how you arrived here, this page is
          for you.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="app-reveal">
        <h3>Why I built this firm</h3>

        <figure class="about-timeline" aria-labelledby="timeline-cap">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 640 90" class="about-timeline-svg" role="img" aria-labelledby="timeline-cap">
            <title id="timeline-cap">A timeline showing the transition from Vanguard to Life Story Wealth Planning, founded in 2012.</title>

            {/* Baseline */}
            <line x1="30" y1="55" x2="610" y2="55" class="tl-line" />

            {/* Vanguard node (left) */}
            <circle cx="120" cy="55" r="5" class="tl-node tl-node-past" />
            <text x="120" y="42" text-anchor="middle" class="tl-label tl-label-eyebrow">Before</text>
            <text x="120" y="82" text-anchor="middle" class="tl-label">Adviser at Vanguard</text>

            {/* Founded 2012 node (middle) */}
            <circle cx="320" cy="55" r="7" class="tl-node tl-node-anchor" />
            <text x="320" y="38" text-anchor="middle" class="tl-label tl-label-year">2012</text>
            <text x="320" y="82" text-anchor="middle" class="tl-label tl-label-rubric">Life Story founded</text>

            {/* Today node (right) */}
            <circle cx="520" cy="55" r="5" class="tl-node tl-node-now" />
            <text x="520" y="42" text-anchor="middle" class="tl-label tl-label-eyebrow">Now</text>
            <text x="520" y="82" text-anchor="middle" class="tl-label">Fiduciary · fee-aligned</text>
          </svg>
          <figcaption class="about-timeline-caption">
            The origin story in one line. The rest of the paragraphs below tell you why the transition happened.
          </figcaption>
        </figure>

        <p>Before this firm, I was an adviser at Vanguard.</p>
        <p>
          The clients I spoke with there were smart people who had built real wealth over long
          careers. They read carefully, they asked real questions, and they were paying attention.
          When markets fell, and they always fall, eventually, those clients would call. They
          wanted to know what we were going to do about their portfolios. They watched the value of
          their accounts drop day after day, and they wanted a plan.
        </p>
        <p>The Vanguard answer was to do nothing. Stay the course. Ride it out.</p>
        <p>
          That answer was not wrong for everyone. For a lot of people it is the right answer. But
          the clients I spoke with were not satisfied with it. They wanted to know why they were
          paying a management fee if nothing was being managed. They had a fair point.
        </p>
        <blockquote class="pull-inline">
          At Vanguard, we were trained to manage clients, not portfolios.
        </blockquote>
        <p>
          I do not say that as a criticism. It is true of most large firms, and there is a business
          reason for it. But it is not the way I want to work, and it is not what the clients I
          spoke with were paying for.
        </p>
        <p>
          So I left, and I built this firm to do the other thing. To actually manage portfolios.
          To reconsider positions every quarter, to move between asset classes when conditions
          change, and to hold cash when nothing deserves capital. To answer the phone when a client
          wants to know what we are doing about a market that is falling, with something better
          than "nothing."
        </p>
        <blockquote class="pull-inline">
          Most clients are not satisfied with an advisor who gets paid to sit on his hands.
        </blockquote>
        <p>That is why this firm exists.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h3>What being a fiduciary means, in practice</h3>
        <p>
          A fiduciary is legally required to act in your interest ahead of their own. In day-to-day
          terms that shapes three things about how I work:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            I do not earn commissions on the products I recommend. My fee structure, described
            on the <a href="/fees">Fees page</a>, pays me only when your portfolio gains value
            above a defined threshold. I do not get paid for holding your assets. I get paid when
            they grow.
          </li>
          <li>
            I do not take custody of your money. It is held at a separate, third-party institution
            in an account in your name. I explain how this works on the <a href="/custody">Custody
            page</a>.
          </li>
          <li>
            I do not answer to a corporate office. I answer to my clients. That is the point of
            the firm.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h3>How I manage money</h3>
        <p>
          The process has a name, I call it <strong>Tzur Magen</strong>, from the Hebrew for
          <em>fortress and shield</em>. It is built around a single idea: risk comes first. Before
          I decide what to buy, I decide what could go wrong and how to guard against it. The full
          explanation, layer by layer, is on the <a href="/approach">Approach page</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h3>Where I am</h3>
        <p>Life Story Wealth Planning is based in Scottsdale, Arizona.</p>
        <p>
          I keep the firm small on purpose. It lets me pay attention to each client's situation
          properly rather than run a book of hundreds.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h3>How to verify me</h3>
        <p>
          You can look up any Registered Investment Advisor in the United States through the SEC's
          public records. My firm's Form ADV, the standard regulatory filing, is linked in the
          footer of every page on this site. If it matters to you to verify anything before we
          speak, that is where to look.
        </p>
      </section>

      <aside class="footnote">
        <h4>A note on the name</h4>
        <p>
          There is an unrelated firm called Life Story Financial. I am not connected with them.
          This site, and my firm, Life Story Wealth Planning, belong to me.
        </p>
      </aside>

      <div class="chapter-cta">
        <a href="/contact" class="cta">Start a conversation</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  /* Asymmetric portrait spread — book-jacket-style hero */
  .about-hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto clamp(3rem, 5vw, 5rem);
    padding: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 5rem) clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem) clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
    align-items: center;
  }
  @media (min-width: 820px) {
    .about-hero {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(240px, 340px) 1fr;
      gap: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 5rem);
    }
  }

  /* Portrait plate — corner-marked frame with AH monogram + firm mark */
  .about-portrait {
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .about-portrait-frame {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;
    max-width: 320px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(120% 80% at 50% 0%, rgba(201, 161, 90, 0.10), transparent 55%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, var(--paper-2, #f4ecdc) 0%, var(--paper, #f2e6c8) 100%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(138, 51, 36, 0.20);
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    box-shadow: 0 26px 60px -30px rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.35);
    padding: 2rem;
  }
  .about-portrait-corner {
    position: absolute;
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--rubric, #8a3324);
  }
  .about-portrait-corner.tl { top: 10px; left: 10px; border-right: none; border-bottom: none; }
  .about-portrait-corner.tr { top: 10px; right: 10px; border-left: none; border-bottom: none; }
  .about-portrait-corner.bl { bottom: 10px; left: 10px; border-right: none; border-top: none; }
  .about-portrait-corner.br { bottom: 10px; right: 10px; border-left: none; border-top: none; }

  .about-portrait-mono {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(4.5rem, 8vw, 6.5rem);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--ink, #1c1712);
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 144, 'SOFT' 100;
    margin-bottom: 0.65rem;
  }
  .about-portrait-rule {
    display: block;
    width: 42px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--rubric, #8a3324);
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  }
  .about-portrait-firm {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.24em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.55);
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .about-portrait-firm em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--rubric, #8a3324);
    text-transform: none;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    display: block;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
  }
  .about-portrait-caption {
    font-family: 'Source Sans 3', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.5);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  /* Copy column — vertical typographic ladder */
  .about-hero-copy {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  .about-hero-eyebrow {
    font-family: 'Source Sans 3', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.32em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--rubric, #8a3324);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .about-hero-h1 {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 0.92;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.15em;
  }
  .about-hero-first {
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.4rem);
    color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.55);
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 120, 'SOFT' 80;
    align-self: flex-start;
    padding-left: 0.15em;
  }
  .about-hero-last {
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(4.2rem, 8vw, 6.5rem);
    color: var(--ink, #1c1712);
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 144, 'SOFT' 40;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
  }
  .about-hero-credentials {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    font-family: 'Source Sans 3', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.72);
    font-weight: 600;
    padding-top: 0.4rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(138, 51, 36, 0.35);
  }
  .ah-sep {
    width: 4px;
    height: 4px;
    background: var(--rubric, #8a3324);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: inline-block;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }
  .about-hero-epigraph {
    font-family: 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.4vw, 1.2rem);
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.72);
    margin: 0.25rem 0 0;
    max-width: 52ch;
    position: relative;
  }
  .ah-quote {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.6em;
    line-height: 0;
    color: var(--rubric, #8a3324);
    vertical-align: -0.28em;
    margin-right: 0.05em;
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .ah-quote-end {
    margin-right: 0;
    margin-left: 0.05em;
  }

  /* Vanguard → 2012 → Now timeline mark, positioned above the origin story */
  .about-timeline {
    margin: 1.5rem 0 2rem;
    padding: 1.5rem clamp(1rem, 3vw, 1.75rem) 1.25rem;
    background: var(--paper-2, #f4ecdc);
    border: 1px solid rgba(138, 51, 36, 0.14);
  }
  .about-timeline-svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    font-family: 'Source Sans 3', system-ui, sans-serif;
  }

  .tl-line {
    stroke: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.28);
    stroke-width: 1;
    stroke-dasharray: 620;
    stroke-dashoffset: 620;
    transition: stroke-dashoffset 1200ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 150ms;
  }
  .app-reveal.is-in .tl-line { stroke-dashoffset: 0; }

  .tl-node {
    fill: var(--ink, #1c1712);
    stroke: none;
    opacity: 0;
    transform-origin: center;
    transform: scale(0.4);
    transition: opacity 500ms ease, transform 500ms cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
  }
  .tl-node-past { fill: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.42); }
  .tl-node-anchor { fill: var(--rubric, #8a3324); }
  .tl-node-now { fill: color-mix(in oklab, var(--brass-soft, #c9a15a) 60%, var(--ink, #1c1712) 40%); }
  .app-reveal.is-in .tl-node { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
  .app-reveal.is-in .tl-node-past { transition-delay: 700ms; }
  .app-reveal.is-in .tl-node-anchor { transition-delay: 1000ms; }
  .app-reveal.is-in .tl-node-now { transition-delay: 1300ms; }

  .tl-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    fill: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.72);
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 500ms ease 1500ms;
  }
  .tl-label-eyebrow {
    font-size: 9.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.28em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    fill: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.5);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .tl-label-year {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 15px;
    fill: var(--rubric, #8a3324);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .tl-label-rubric {
    fill: var(--rubric, #8a3324);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .app-reveal.is-in .tl-label { opacity: 1; }

  .about-timeline-caption {
    font-family: 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.58);
    text-align: center;
    margin: 1rem auto 0;
    max-width: 52ch;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .tl-line, .tl-node, .tl-label {
      opacity: 1; transform: none; transition: none; stroke-dashoffset: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
